{"4902250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prisoners Chess", "steam_appid": 4902250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU KNOW HOW THE PIECES MOVE.. YOU DON'T KNOW HOW THEY DIE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The damned are the pieces. You are the one who moves them. Captures aren't removals. They're kills. Only one of you will escape hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/53476d25a95d7d1ea2b52c88ef8a2a6d.poster.avif?t=1788230457\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/53476d25a95d7d1ea2b52c88ef8a2a6d.webm?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/53476d25a95d7d1ea2b52c88ef8a2a6d.mp4?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU TOO, BRUTUS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend prison to meet other prisoners. Lucifer, Caesar, Judas, Cleopatra.... there's many inhabiting the floors. Be careful though, these prisoners don't play by the rules.  Well... neither do you. Thunder? Bribery? perhaps firing canons from their ship? be prepared for each floor of.... prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/e7a81210d9e563172bde30419de1cd92.avif?t=1788230457\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras_big/e7a81210d9e563172bde30419de1cd92.webp?t=1788230457 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO WAYS TO WIN. THEY DECIDE WHAT YOU BECOME.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the enemy King and the battle ends clean. Or... ignore him entirely and bleed the army out, one body at a time, until they rout. Hell is watching which one you pick and your Salvation changes the game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/4fe01fa1fa54acccb515d26c6147eb5a.poster.avif?t=1788230457\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/4fe01fa1fa54acccb515d26c6147eb5a.webm?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/4fe01fa1fa54acccb515d26c6147eb5a.mp4?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RELICS THAT EMPOWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kings that can move like Knights? Pawns that explode when they die? in prison, we don't play by the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/2c53c45906c6236476b0cc983c42e5ca.poster.avif?t=1788230457\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/2c53c45906c6236476b0cc983c42e5ca.webm?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/2c53c45906c6236476b0cc983c42e5ca.mp4?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAUNTLET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A weekly ladder fought against other prisoners who tried to escape. Nobody waits on anybody. Win runs, climb the board - be the one that escapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/f56e14058af40e260a32c5bb310073da.poster.avif?t=1788230457\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/f56e14058af40e260a32c5bb310073da.webm?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/f56e14058af40e260a32c5bb310073da.mp4?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU KNOW HOW THE PIECES MOVE.. YOU DON'T KNOW HOW THEY DIE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The damned are the pieces. You are the one who moves them. Captures aren't removals. They're kills. Only one of you will escape hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/53476d25a95d7d1ea2b52c88ef8a2a6d.poster.avif?t=1788230457\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/53476d25a95d7d1ea2b52c88ef8a2a6d.webm?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4902250/extras/53476d25a95d7d1ea2b52c88ef8a2a6d.mp4?t=1788230457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU TOO, BRUTUS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend prison to meet other prisoners. Lucifer, Caesar, Judas, Cleopatra.... there's many inhabiting the floors. Be careful though, these prisoners don't play by the rules.  Well... neither do you. Thunder? Bribery? perhaps firing canons from their ship? be prepared for each floor of.... prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 